&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dual-funnel experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Running both self-serve funnels (PLG) and enterprise sales handoffs (PLS).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
